                    <a href="https://gamma.app" target="_blank" class="badge bg-dark text-white text-decoration-none py-2 px-3 rounded-pill">
                        <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right me-1"></i> Gamma.app (ทำสไลด์อัตโนมัติ)
                    </a>
                    <a href="https://chatgpt.com" target="_blank" class="badge bg-success text-white text-decoration-none py-2 px-3 rounded-pill">
                        <i class="bi bi-chat-text me-1"></i> ChatGPT (GPT-4o)
